    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, i'll try the breathing stuff but it feels like a temporary fix. it's more like this energy is always there, just waiting for a moment where i lose control. it feels less like a \"feeling\" and more like an actual physical field around me that fluctuates. like, when i'm calm, everything is fine, but the second i get frustrated, it's like my aura or whatever becomes unstable and starts leaking. is there a way to actually stabilize that field so it's not constantly reacting to every little mood swing? i'm worried i'm going to end up causing a massive electrical surge if i have a real breakdown.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
